    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3928" root="تسع" body-key="t">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسّعهُ</span></b>  <i>He made it nine.</i> (Esh-Sheybánee,
and K voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَحَّدَ</span>.) [See also 1.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسّع لِٱمْرَأَتِهِ</span>,
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدَهَا</span>, <i>He remained nine nights with his wife:</i>
and in like manner the verb is used in relation to
any saying or action. (TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبَّعَ</span>.)

